  "instruction": "## Goal\nRestore the original behavior of `minidump.common_structs.MinidumpMemorySegment.search` so that it no longer raises `NotImplementedError` and instead correctly searches a memory segment for a byte pattern.\n\n## Observable behavior\n```python\n# Example 1: find all occurrences\nseg = MinidumpMemorySegment()\nseg.start_virtual_address = 0x1000\nseg.size = 0x100\nseg.start_file_address = 0x0\nseg.end_virtual_address = 0x1100\n\ndata = b\"X\" * 10 + b\"PATTERN\" + b\"Y\" * 20 + b\"PATTERN\" + b\"Z\" * 200\nfh = FakeFileHandler(data)\n\nresult = seg.search(b\"PATTERN\", fh)\nassert len(result) == 2\nassert result[0] == 0x1000 + 10\nassert result[1] == 0x1000 + 10 + 7 + 20\n```\n\n```python\n# Example 2: find first occurrence\nseg = MinidumpMemorySegment()\nseg.start_virtual_address = 0x1000\nseg.size = 0x100\nseg.start_file_address = 0x0\nseg.end_virtual_address = 0x1100\n\ndata = b\"X\" * 10 + b\"PATTERN\" + b\"Y\" * 20 + b\"PATTERN\" + b\"Z\" * 200\nfh = FakeFileHandler(data)\n\nresult = seg.search(b\"PATTERN\", fh, find_first=True)\nassert result == [0x1000 + 10]\n```\n\n## Constraints\n- Keep the existing method signature: `search(self, pattern, file_handler, find_first=False, chunksize=50 * 1024)`.\n- Do not change any other public API in `minidump.common_structs`.\n- The implementation must work with both synchronous file handlers (with `tell`, `seek`, `read`) and the async variants used by the broader codebase, but the core search logic belongs in `search`.\n- Files in scope include `minidump/common_structs.py` and the test file `tests/generated/test_minidump_common_structs.py`.\n\n## How success is measured\nThe following verifier tests must pass:\n```\npython -m pytest -q tests/generated/test_minidump_common_structs.py::TestMinidumpMemorySegmentSearch::test_search_chunksize_boundary tests/generated/test_minidump_common_structs.py::TestMinidumpMemorySegmentSearch::test_search_find_all tests/generated/test_minidump_common_structs.py::TestMinidumpMemorySegmentSearch::test_search_find_first tests/generated/test_minidump_common_structs.py::TestMinidumpMemorySegmentSearch::test_search_not_found tests/generated/test_minidump_common_structs.py::TestMinidumpMemorySegmentSearch::test_search_pattern_too_long tests/generated/test_minidump_common_structs.py::TestMinidumpMemorySegmentSearch::test_search_restores_position\n```",
